# The castle-state test of the siege guards' hooks (the pledge castle state is not 2) on
# Aden's guards and the character whose clan owns Aden Castle (5): the standing wizard
# (35249) that sees it casts nothing at it, and a knight (35235) it hits wants nothing of it,
# its attacked hook and the hit's clan call alike.
character Hunter 20
clan 5
siege 5 owner
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizardStand
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc wizard 35249 SiegeGuard 150 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill DD_MAGIC 4114 1
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 -400 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

approach wizard
  desires wizard -

hit knight 22
  hate knight 0
  desires knight -
